te, Kaj Sierhuis —who had been booked just moments earlier in stoppage time—delivered a pinpoint assist for Emre Mor . The substitute made no mistake, firing the ball into the net to make it 2-1. Despite a flurry of late substitutions and a yellow card for Bruno Onyemaechi , Olympiakos could not find a way back into the match. The final whistle confirmed a famous victory for NEC Nijmegen , as they capitalized on their extra man to secure all three points in a memorable European night."
